{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google母公司 Alphabet 最新公佈的第三季度財報顯示，在人工智能技術推動下，Google搜索業務迎來了近五年來最快的查詢增長速度。然而，儘管用户使用量持續攀升，搜索業務收入增速卻有所放緩，這讓投資者開始重新審視Google AI戰略的商業前景。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585020.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:06:32.120477+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:50:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:54.365324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:54.365324+00:00","content_hash":"bcf0d0bb9d2abf17b6eb74e59e46ace294c7bca6be091919e815cfd610fb5d1c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}